RESULT A (exact ancestral set): because LAYER 0 IS GLOBAL, S_0 = [0, n) after a
single layer. Every token in the sequence, however far, is an ancestor of the
marker at depth 1. The reachability graph has diameter 1.

RESULT B (per-hop horizon requested by the task): if the layer-0 short circuit is
excluded and only per-hop composition counts, the horizon at the global layers is
