 7     21         65472               7891      100.00%

minimum layer index L*(d) under the per-hop horizon:
     d =  L*(d)   closed form  global hops used k  global hops REMAINING (8-k)   entry-dilution 1/(k+1)
       1      0             0                   0                            8                    1.000
      64      0             0                   0                            8                    1.000
      65      0             0                   0                            8                    1.000
     128      0             0                   0                            8                    1.000
     129      3             0                   1                            7                    0.500
     449      3             3                   1                            7                    0.500
     960      3             3                   1                            7                    0.500
     961      6             6                   2                            6                    0.333
    1984      6             6                   2                            6                    0.333
    1985      9             9                   3                            5                    0.250
    4032      9             9                   3                            5                    0.250
    4033     12            12                   4                            4                    0.200
    7000     12            12                   4                            4                    0.200
    8128     12            12                   4                            4                    0.200
    8129     15            15                   5                            3                    0.167
    8191     15            15                   5                            3                    0.167
closed form: L*(d) = 0 for d <= 2w;  L*(d) = 3*ceil(log2((d/w + 1)/8)) for d > 2w
(R_k = (8*2^k - 1)w >= d  <=>  2^k >= (d/w + 1)/8  <=>  k >= log2((d/w+1)/8))

